WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:04.100
-This weekend, Naomi Osaka
played Veronika Kudermetova

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.200
at BNP Paribas Open,
but the match was interrupted

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.100
when a woman in the crowd
yelled, "Naomi, you suck!"

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.534
An incident that brought Osaka
to tears.

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:15.067
Here to comment, is one of our
writers Amber Ruffin, everybody.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:17.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Hi!

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.834
Hi.
Yeah, hi.

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:23.234
Hey. Hi.
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:25.234
You guys, thank you.
Hi, Seth!

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:27.234
It really made me mad
when this happened

00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:29.968
because
I love her so much.

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:34.067
So I just wanted to drop by with
a special message of support

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.067
for Naomi Osaka.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:39.067
Naomi, we are so proud of you
and we love you.

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:41.501
And we're gonna support you
no matter what you do.

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:43.000
-Aw. That's very nice.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.267
-I've also got a message
for her heckler.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.667
I'm gonna find you.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.434
I'm gonna find you and I'm gonna
rip you up

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:52.300
like a piece of paper.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.400
You wanna yell,
"Naomi, you suck"?

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.400
Well, you know what sucks?
Your chances of survival.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.767
-Amber!
Amber, you cannot say that.

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:03.434
-I can't say how I feel?
-No, you can't threaten people.

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:04.868
-Seth!

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:07.267
How could I even rip someone up
like a piece of paper?

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:08.801
That's not possible.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:12.100
Unless I have freakishly strong
hands from years of doing

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:15.367
sign language and gymnastics.
-Amber!

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:19.367
-It's fine! I don't even know
who the heckler was!

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:22.367
You can tell I don't know who
she was because I'm not in jail.

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:25.667
Serving a life sentence for
slapping her to death

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:27.834
and then slapping her back to
life again.

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:30.200
-You can't say that!
-What?

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.067
I said I slap her back to life?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.067 --> 00:01:34.701
Seth, no one knows who did it.

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:38.300
So technically, I'm not
threatening anyone when I say,

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:40.200
I'm gonna feed you beans.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.234
I'm gonna rip off your face and
put it in your butt

00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:46.534
and then the thing that kills
you will be your own farts.

00:01:46.534 --> 00:01:48.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:52.000
-That's enough! Look, just why
not concentrate on Naomi.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.634
-Man, that child is strong.
She doesn't need me.

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:56.200
She doesn't need help from
anybody.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.234
But you know who does need help?

00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:01.767
You, you little heckling punk!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.767 --> 00:02:04.400
Don't sleep 'cause I'm gonna
kill you in your dreams

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.200
like Freddy Krueger!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.667
One, two,
Amber's coming for you.

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:11.501
Three, four,
better shut the door.

00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:12.801
-Amber!

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:15.501
-Five, six that was just for
kicks. Seth, I'm kidding!

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:17.133
-Amber,
this is all very unlike you.

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:19.501
-Seth, you're right.
And I'm sorry.

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:22.167
And I'd like to apologize.

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:25.200
Hey, little heckler.
I'm sorry

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.133
for what I'm gonna so to your
face, 'cause girl,

00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:29.200
when I find you --
-Stop it!

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.767
-I'm gonna hug you.
-Okay.

00:02:31.767 --> 00:02:33.400
-Till I squeeze all the air out.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.300
[ Laughter ]
-Amber Ruffin, everybody.

